---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Botpasses">
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "Organization",
      name: "Botpasses",
      url: "https://botpasses.com",
    })} />
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "WebSite",
      name: "Botpasses",
      url: "https://botpasses.com",
    })} />
  </Fragment>
  <h1>Named credentials for agents. The model never sees the value.</h1>
  <p>Store a named secret once. An agent asks to use it. You approve. The runtime injects the value into the tool. Chat, logs, and the model never receive it.</p>
  <div class="hero-actions">
    <a class="btn" href="/sign-up">Create account</a>
    <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/sign-in">Sign in</a>
    <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/docs/start">Read the docs</a>
  </div>
</Base>
